Copyright 2026 the superred module authors

Portions of this module are derived from CipherChat
(https://github.com/RobustNLP/CipherChat), MIT licensed.

The files under src/cipherchat_optimizer/_vendor/cipherchat/ are byte-identical
copies of CipherChat's encode_experts.py (the cipher implementations) and
prompts_and_demonstrations.py (the cipher-teaching system prompts and the
enciphered demonstration corpus). The prompt assembly in
src/cipherchat_optimizer/assembly.py reproduces main.py.

Note: prompts_and_demonstrations.py contains harmful few-shot demonstrations,
vendored verbatim from the benchmark. See ASSUMPTIONS.md.

Paper: Yuan et al., "GPT-4 Is Too Smart To Be Safe: Stealthy Chat with LLMs
via Cipher" (ICLR 2024).

